// Syncthing ignore list for the raw-simulation-data sync.
//
// Division of labour: git carries the analysis outputs (figures, CSVs,
// notebooks, run_config.json, summaries) -- those are small and tracked.
// Syncthing carries ONLY the raw .parquet / .pkl trajectories, which are
// gitignored because they are ~4.9 GB. Keeping the two disjoint means
// Syncthing never fights a git checkout.

// --- carried by git, so excluded here ---
.git
.ipynb_checkpoints
.stignore
*.png
*.csv
*.ipynb
*.md
*.json
*.txt
*.tex

// --- machine-local, regenerated each run ---
*.log
progress.jsonl
